OIS-ROP/1.0
[METADATA]
name: mario
description: Super Mario Bros theme - 12 Beep/Sleep calls in one ROP chain
author: Chris Aziz / Bombadil Systems
[SUBSTRATES]
kernel32.dll
ntdll.dll
[CHAIN]
call kernel32.dll Beep 659 125
call kernel32.dll Beep 659 125
call kernel32.dll Sleep 125
call kernel32.dll Beep 659 125
call kernel32.dll Sleep 167
call kernel32.dll Beep 523 125
call kernel32.dll Beep 659 125
call kernel32.dll Sleep 125
call kernel32.dll Beep 784 125
call kernel32.dll Sleep 375
call kernel32.dll Beep 392 125
call kernel32.dll Sleep 375
[END]
